policy                      reward success   lost critLo   reloc   preem   react    prot    sla  latency    energy
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
mappo (real risk)            15.69   0.741   10.4    4.2    29.1    27.6     1.5     3.2    0.1    275.1    2085.7
mappo (risk=0)               19.85   0.737   10.5    4.2    28.6    27.5     1.1     2.9    0.0    273.5    2076.4
